1
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:06,742
Everything you do with a contact works on a lead.

2
00:00:06,742 --> 00:00:10,810
Open a lead, and use List Activities to see its activities.

3
00:00:11,304 --> 00:00:17,852
Add Activity, Outbound, schedules a call or a text, and Inbound logs one the lead started.

4
00:00:17,852 --> 00:00:24,264
Leads can also be loaded as activities, and retried by a subject flow, like any contact.

